{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中原地產天水圍副區域營業董事伍耀祖表示，新晉屋苑備受買家追捧，天水圍YOHO West本月錄得9宗二手買賣成交，平均實用呎價約13569元。<br/>伍耀祖表示，YOHO West第一期2A座低層A6室，實用面積302平方呎，屬一房單位，向北，叫價458萬元，以435萬元成交，實用呎價14404元。原業主於2023年12月以394.02萬元一手買入單位，持貨2年多，賬面獲利40.98萬元，升幅10.4%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.461693+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T14:58:02.715835+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:55.924987+00:00","content_hash":"7946ae81e816d5348bfaeaac72880a00eb9758c6d6a7d32ad92c14cd0e51ffd6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}